        "created_at": "2015-04-30T03:24:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Vis is tricky for us. Either she goes gangbusters, or flops. Very rarely is she 'useful, but not great'. I'm still learning all the little ins and outs, but it's taking some time. I try to add her into the lineup on the app whenever I can, just for practice. My main gaming buddy used her once, and hated her. And he's the one who usually uses Blue decks in Magic!&nbsp; I really like that Enforcers/Chairman combo mentioned above, can't wait to try it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As an aside, where are those Sentinels character cards from? They look amazing!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-Brian</p>",
